Front":"手工","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L11-2-05\",\"之間\",\"之間\",\"之间\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:要不是你幫忙，現在我還找不到工作呢！ B:沒什麼，朋友之間本來就應該互相幫助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-05","sourceFront":"之間","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他最近對你說話的態度變得冷淡，你們之間是不是有什麼誤會？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-18","sourceFront":"冷淡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你們之間的誤會越來越深，要是不面對面說清楚，恐怕連朋友都當不成了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-11","sourceFront":"對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"當我遇到挫折時，他總是協助我克服困難，我們之間也建立了珍貴的友誼。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-15","sourceFront":"友誼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"簡老闆因為生意的關係，經常接觸越南人，相當了解兩國之間工作習慣的差異。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-12","sourceFront":"接觸","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"自從有了高速鐵路，不僅縮短了交通時間，人與人之間的距離也變近了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-22","sourceFront":"高速","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果同事之間不願意溝通，這個會議怎麼開下去呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-21","sourceFront":"下去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國家跟國家之間的外交關係很重要，這方面的工作是總統負責的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-08","sourceFront":"外交","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這是我和你之間的祕密，你絕對不可告訴別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-12","sourceFront":"祕密","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人與人之間的感情很珍貴，就算擁有再多的錢也買不到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-39","sourceFront":"感情","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國與美國之間的貿易問題很嚴重，這個新聞早就上電視了。","pi