生從不發脾氣，人也很謙虛，不論別人怎麼批評他，他還是很客氣地說謝謝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-26","sourceFront":"不論","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"面試時必須穿正式的服裝，跟老闆對話時，也應表現出客氣、 謙虛的態度。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-24","sourceFront":"應","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爸爸常教導我做人要謙虛，太驕傲的話，不僅讓人討厭，做事也可能不順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-15","sourceFront":"驕傲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位業務員不但謙虛而且誠實，你有需要的話可以請他協助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-01","sourceFront":"業務員","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 謙(humble) and 虛(false): 謙虛 means modest."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-2-06\",\"事實上\",\"事實上\",\"事实上\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"有人以為身體沒什麼毛病就代表很健康，這樣的想法事實上不完全正確。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-06","sourceFront":"事實上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Grounded in real 事(affair) facts on 實(real) ground 上(on): 事實上 means in fact, in reality."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-06\",\"转\",\"轉\",\"转\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這臺洗衣機不轉了，請你拿去修理一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-06","sourceFront":"轉","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"今明兩天的天氣可能從晴天轉雨天，出門前記得帶傘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-05","sourceFront":"轉","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你先往左轉，再往右轉，就到那家餐廳了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-1-14","sourceFront":"轉","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現在的手機都具有語音轉成文字的功能，用來記錄事情非常便利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-14","sourceFront":"語音","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電視臺常在熱門比賽的轉播中放一些廣告，靠這種方式來賺錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-12","sourceFront":"轉播","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從國外坐飛機到臺灣來，有時需要轉機。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-46","sourceFront":"轉機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天搭捷運參加演唱會的民眾很多，車上擠得都不能轉身。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-30","sourceFront":"轉身","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-16\",\"做\",\"做\",\"做\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我家的廚房很大，我常常在家做飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiā de chúfáng hěn dà, wǒ chángcháng zài jiā zuòfàn.","english":"My kitchen is quite big, I often cook at home.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-26","sourceFront":"廚房","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他在房間外面做什麼？","pinyin":"Tā zài fángjiān wàimiàn zuò shénme?","english":"What is he doing outside of the room?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-08","sourceFront":"外（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我很喜歡做飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ hěn xǐhuān zuòfàn.","english":"I like cooking very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-3-08","sourceFront":"做飯","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你今天要做什麼？","pinyin":"Nǐ jīntiān yào zuò shénme?","english":"What do you want to do today?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-3-01","sourceFront":"做","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這是我朋友做的，因為他屬虎。妳知道十二生肖嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè shì wǒ péngyou zuò de, yīnwèi tā shǔ hǔ. Nǐ zhīdào shí'èr shēngxiào ma?","english":"This is the lantern that my friend made because his Chinese zodiac animal sign is tiger. Do you know the Chinese animal zodiac?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"好。我先回宿舍做功課，再跟你一起去找他。","pinyin":"Hǎo. Wǒ xiān huí sùshè zuò gōngkè, zài gēn nǐ yìqǐ qù zhǎo tā.","english":"Okay. I will go back to the dormitory to do my homework first, then I will go to see him with you.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-01","sourceFront":"句子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我很忙，現在要去廚房做飯，你再去房間找吧。","pinyin":"Wǒ hěn máng, xiànzài yào qù chúfáng zuòfàn, nǐ zài qù fángjiān zhǎo ba.","english":"I am very busy and I am going to the kitchen to cook now. You go check your room again.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"友美，妳這個週末要做什麼？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi, nǐ zhè ge zhōumò yào zuò shénme?","english":"Youmei, what are you going to do this weekend?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) finds a 故(reason) to roll up sleeves and wash every dish → 做(do)."},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-18\",\"内科\",\"內科\",\"内科\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家醫院的內科有最新設備，因此成為許多病人的第一選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-18","sourceFront":"內科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-41\",\"鮮血\",\"鮮血\",\"鲜血\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個甜點的顏色像鮮血一樣，讓我嚇了一跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-41","sourceFront":"鮮血","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L11-2-15\",\"牽\",\"牽\",\"牵\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"金小姐常利用假日，牽著家中那隻活潑的小黑狗到街上逛逛。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-15","sourceFront":"牽","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-40\",\"農民\",\"農民/農夫\",\"农民/农夫\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"學校安排我們到鄉下當「一日農民」，體驗農夫的辛苦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-40","sourceFront":"農民","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-37\",\"勞力\",\"勞力\",\"劳力\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"人們為了節省勞力，發明了許多實用的機械。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-37","sourceFront":"勞力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-2-25\",\"裁判\",\"裁判\",\"裁判\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"裁判的工作是確定每位選手都遵守規定，讓比賽順利進行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-25","sourceFront":"裁判","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"上次\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"上(on top) + 次(times) → the time on top, the one before now: last time."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"久\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 勹(wrap) pulls tight around endless waiting → 久(long)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"例如\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 例(precedent) and 如(if): 例如 means for example."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"充\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Under a shelter 亠(lid), a 厶(private) stash is carried on sturdy 儿(legs) until containers 充(fill)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"居\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 尸(body) crouches down to settle inside a 古(old) house, so that is where it will 居(live)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"故\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"an 古(old) gate takes a 攵(rap) of paint → stories of 故(old; past) days."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"樓上\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"樓(floor) + 上(on top) → the floor on top is upstairs."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"汽水\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 汽(gasoline) and 水(water): 汽水 means soda, soft drink."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"父母\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"父(father) + 母(mother) → parents."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"生肖\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"The animal you resemble (肖) from your birth (生) year is your zodiac sign."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"銷售\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 銷(fuse) and 售(sell): 銷售 means sell."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"饅\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Bakers knead soft 飠(food) dough into long 曼(long) rolls before steaming warm 饅(steamed buns)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"騙子\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A handy item for 騙(cheat) with suffix 子(child): 騙子 means liar, cheat."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"魅\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A haunting presence as captivating as a mythical 鬼(ghost) holds an allure that is 未(not yet) fully understood: 魅(charm)."}]}
